  rolling daily-window scan)

  1) PREVIOUS MONTH RED: closed below its open.
  2) CURRENT MONTH GREEN: closes above its open.
  3) REVERSAL MAGNITUDE: current month's % gain exceeds
     reversal_multiplier (2x) the previous month's
     % decline — e.g. a -5% month followed by a +10%+ month.
  4) STRUCTURE: current month's close is above the MONTHLY 50-period
     SMA (a moving average of monthly closes, ~4 years of history —
     not the usual daily SMA50).

  📋 DATA SOURCING
  Only 1 download per ticker: daily bars (~2500 days, ~7 years —
  needed to build 50+ monthly bars for a stable monthly SMA50),
  resampled to monthly ('ME') — no separate network calls needed.

